msgid "For will be, you’ll also hear <0>saab</0> with the <1>ma</1> infinitive: <2><3/>.</2> It came into written Estonian on the German model. The Estonian Language Institute’s handbook advises the present wherever it does the job: <4><5/>.</4> Don’t mix up <6>saab olema</6> with <7>saan</7> and the <8>da</8> infinitive, I can, from lesson {infinitives}."
msgstr "For will be, you’ll also hear <0>saab</0> with the <1>ma</1> infinitive: <2><3/>.</2> It came into written Estonian on the German model. The Estonian Language Institute’s handbook advises the present wherever it does the job: <4><5/>.</4> Don’t mix up <6>saab olema</6> with <7>saan</7> and the <8>da</8> infinitive, I can, from lesson {infinitives}."

